        "title": "Furniture History: Period Styles to Modernism",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Furniture history is the intersection of three forces: available materials and technology, prevailing cultural values and patronage systems, and trade routes moving both objects and ideas between regions. Each major stylistic shift is intelligible once you understand the pressure that generated it."
    },
